[ti:Bubblin']
[ar:HIMEHINA]
[re:Gramophone demo. These lines explain the player. They are not the song's lyrics.]
[00:00.50]These lines are not the lyrics of Bubblin'
[00:00.50]これは「Bubblin'」の歌詞ではありません
[00:04.00]They show what the Gramophone lyrics panel can do
[00:04.00]Gramophone の歌詞パネルでできることを紹介します
[00:07.50]Each line lights up when the song reaches it
[00:07.50]曲がその位置に来ると、行が光ります
[00:11.00]Click a line to jump to that moment
[00:11.00]行をクリックすると、その瞬間へ移動します
[00:14.50]A translation can sit under every line
[00:14.50]各行の下に翻訳を置けます
[00:18.00]Lines with the same time move together
[00:18.00]同じ時刻の行は一緒に動きます
[00:21.50]The lyrics come from an LRC file on the wiki
[00:21.50]歌詞はウィキの LRC ファイルから読み込まれます
[00:25.00]or from another site that allows it
[00:25.00]許可された別のサイトからも読み込めます
[00:28.00]Thanks for listening
[00:28.00]聴いてくれてありがとう
